    "summary": "Fred Finch Youth & Family Services is a nonprofit based in Oakland, California, that provides mental health care and support services for young people and families. Its programs include family services, housing, young adult services, residential treatment, and school and educational services. It operates certified non-public schools for students with developmental disabilities and serious emotional disturbance, and provides school-based services in partnership with public school districts.",
